  "body": "To install or update `git-branchless`, run the following:\r\n\r\n```console\r\n$ cargo install --locked git-branchless\r\n$ git branchless init  # in your repository\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Release highlights\r\n\r\n*None.* This is a fixup release that includes no new features or changes in behavior.\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n- (#1672): `scm-bisect` has been updated (was missed in v0.11.0)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/arxanas/git-branchless/compare/v0.11.0...v0.11.1\r\n\r\nIf you're interested in contributing, check out the Developer Guide in the [Wiki](https://github.com/arxanas/git-branchless/wiki), or post in the [Discussions](https://github.com/arxanas/git-branchless/discussions) or [Discord server](https://discord.gg/caYQBJ82A4) to ask any questions.\r\n\r\n",
